Dragon Burst game 0009: v7.3's sign-in with any controller and latency probe on Android too

SDK 0192 brought the PC SDK's movable signed-in user (40f162f) and the latency probe (e6fabfb), which 0005 had left
out for this SDK: the sign-in moves to the pad that pressed Start, and BurstLimitPlayTime logs player 1's action for
latency_log. The UI watchdog (b5ef429) is back by itself (0005's __has_include).

